```
src/lib/
├── secrets/google.ts          # AWS Secrets Manager config
├── connections/google-sheets.ts # googleapis client factory
├── services/sheets-service.ts   # Business logic + structure analysis
└── utils/google-rate-limit.ts  # Rate limiting & error handling
```

## 🚨 ERROR HANDLING SPECIFICS

- **429**: Implement retry with `retry-after` header
- **403**: "Check service account permissions and sheet sharing"
- **404**: "Sheet not found or service account lacks access"
- **400**: "Check range format and parameters"

